---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Resume | Deanna Tran"
  description="Resume of Deanna Tran, Senior Product Engineer at Cloudflare. Experience in product engineering, design systems, and full-stack development."
>
  <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto md:my-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-none shadow-[0_4px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] p-8 md:p-12 max-md:mx-4 max-md:p-6 resume-paper">
      
      <!-- Header: Avatar + Contact -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-5 mb-6 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-center max-md:gap-4">        
        <div class="flex-1 max-md:text-center">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-1 text-[#1a1a2e] max-md:text-2xl">deanna tran</h1>
          <p class="text-base text-[#a855f7] mb-3">senior product engineer</p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#6a6a7a] max-md:justify-center">
            <span>new york, ny</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <a href="mailto:itsdeannatran@gmail.com" class="hover:text-[#a855f7] transition-colors">itsdeannatran@gmail.com</a>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>856-405-7989</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/deannatran" class="hover:text-[#a855f7] transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin</a>
            <span>·</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/dnntrn" class="hover:text-[#a855f7] transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9a9aaa] mb-2">skills</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">react</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">typescript</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">cloudflare workers</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">tailwindcss</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">product engineering</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">design systems</span>
          <span class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#6a6a7a] bg-[rgba(168,85,247,0.08)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">cross-functional collaboration</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9a9aaa] mb-3">experience</h2>
        
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">cloudflare</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">apr 2026 – present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#a855f7] mb-1">senior software engineer</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>rebuilding the operational platform behind soc-as-a-service: redefining broken processes before building the system so it enforces better workflows</li>
            <li>shifting engineering culture from "build what's requested" to "understand the user problem first"</li>
            <li>coaching non-technical stakeholders on leveraging ai for research and operational workflows</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">cloudflare</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">may 2024 – apr 2026</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#a855f7] mb-1">software engineer</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>reduced legal response processing time by 80-90% and eliminated engineering involvement in routine requests</li>
            <li>built a metadata-driven ui framework where t&s analysts self-serve adjust their own workflows</li>
            <li>primary frontend owner for all legal response uis: geoblock, prtt, preservation tooling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">season</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">jul 2022 – nov 2023</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#a855f7] mb-1">frontend engineer</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>delivered patient-facing cart checkout, intake forms, and third-party vendor storefront</li>
            <li>created internal design system with reusable components, increasing team dev speed</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">ellevest</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">jul 2021 – jun 2022</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#a855f7] mb-1">software engineer ii</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>developed core mobile + web features resulting in 4% conversion increase and 20% funding rate increase</li>
            <li>planned and led a maintenance sprint reducing tech debt and increasing cross-team collaboration</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">ellevest</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">jul 2020 – jul 2021</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#a855f7] mb-1">software engineer i</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>promoted from intern to full-time; contributed production react native code to ios app</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-0.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-0">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#1a1a2e]">contractor + intern</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#9a9aaa]">sep 2019 – jun 2020</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#6a6a7a] text-sm space-y-0.5">
            <li>early career: react native, redux, mobile automation testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Education -->
      <div class="border-t border-[rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] pt-4">
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9a9aaa] mb-2">education</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6a6a7a]">ba computer science, new york university, 2020. minors: web design and linguistics.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
